version 2.2.1    2026-07-27

- Refactor: consolidate Network*Request classes — eliminate ~250 lines of duplicated code via shared base-class helpers (prepareRequest, evaluateOutcome, handleFailure, collectResponse, disposeReply)
- Refactor: centralize all Qt version #if blocks into source/qtcompat.h (single maintenance point, Qt6-ready)
- Refactor: extract common progress throttle into reusable ProgressThrottle component (shared by download/upload/MT-download)
- Refactor: replace implicit MT-download phase switching with explicit state machine (Probe → RangeProbe → MultiDownload)
- Refactor: replace hard-coded switch-case factory with self-registering priority-based NetworkRequestRegistry
- Style: design pattern application — Template Method (base class lifecycle), Strategy (retry/redirect/SSL), State (MT phase lifecycle), Registry (extensible factory)


version 2.2.0    2026-07-23

- Feat: structured errors — new public header include/networkerror.h (ErrorCategory / ErrorCode / ErrorInfo)
- Break: ResponseResult flat error fields removed (success/cancelled/timeout/errorCode/errorMessage); use ResponseResult::error plus isSuccess()/isCancelled()/isTimeout(); statusCode retained
- Refactor: map QNetworkReply::NetworkError and HTTP status into stable library error codes (makeNetworkError/makeHttpError)


version 2.1.6    2026-07-22

- Feat: RequestContextBuilder fluent API (replaces manual RequestContext field assignment)
- Refactor: split god header networkrequestdefs.h into focused headers
- Docs: update README examples to use RequestContextBuilder pattern
- Docs: add SSL/TLS configuration example to README


version 2.1.5    2026-07-21

- Fix: undefined type in public header (networkrequestevent.h)
- Fix: deleteLater() memory leak in NetworkRequest destructor
- Fix: exception catch type mismatch (std::exception* → const std::exception&)
- Fix: premature shared_ptr reset in stop methods (use-after-free risk)
- Fix: misleading lambda indentation in Downloader progress handler
- Fix: spelling corrections (iBtyes→iBytes, regiester→registerEvent)
- Test: add request cancellation regression tests (stop running/batch/all + stress)
- Test: add /delay endpoint to HttpTestServer for slow-response simulation


version 2.1.4    2025-09-02

- Multi-threaded download improvements with duplicate part detection
- Updated build system with better cross-platform compatibility


